● Frontend is complete, verified, and clean. Summary:

  - Scaffolded Vite + React 18 + TS (strict) with the exact dependency set
    requested; eslint and tsc --noEmit both pass with zero errors/warnings.
  - httpClient.ts: Axios + JWT interceptor + normalized ApiError + 401→logout;
    routing with /login, /employee/*, /admin/*, RoleGuard, lazy pages,
    ErrorBoundary, MUI nav. Login verified working against seeded users.
  - Employee features built: Upload (type/size-validated picker → auto-navigates
    to review), Review (file preview + RHF/Zod form prefilled from extraction,
    low-confidence fields highlighted, category dropdown with
    suggestion/confidence, Save/Submit, shows admin rejection comment), My
    Receipts (table, status chips, filter, pagination), and a dashboard summary
    card.
  - Found and fixed 3 backend gaps while wiring this up: no /auth/login endpoint
    existed at all (built it), ReceiptRead was missing extraction_confidence
    (needed for the highlighting feature), and categories were admin-only (added
    an employee-readable GET /api/v1/categories). All backend checks (mypy
    --strict/ruff/bandit) still pass.
  - Admin UI is just a placeholder route (not in this task's scope).

