  Workflow Verification

  ┌─────────────┬──────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ Transition  │ Implemented? │                   Where                    │
  ├─────────────┼──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │             │              │ ReceiptService.upload() — sets UPLOADED on │
  │ UPLOADED →  │ ✅ Yes       │  construction, runs                        │
  │ EXTRACTED   │              │ extraction+categorization, sets EXTRACTED  │
  │             │              │ before commit.                             │
  ├─────────────┼──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ EXTRACTED → │              │ ReceiptService.submit() — gated by         │
  │  SUBMITTED  │ ✅ Yes       │ SUBMITTABLE_STATUSES = {EXTRACTED,         │
  │             │              │ REJECTED}.                                 │
  ├─────────────┼──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ SUBMITTED → │ ✅ Yes       │ ReceiptService.approve() — gated by        │
  │  APPROVED   │              │ REVIEWABLE_STATUSES = {SUBMITTED}.         │
  ├─────────────┼──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │             │              │ ReceiptService.reject() — same gate,       │
  │ SUBMITTED → │ ✅ Yes       │ requires non-empty comment (schema         │
  │  REJECTED   │              │ Field(min_length=1) + 422 if blank,        │
  │             │              │ live-verified).                            │
  ├─────────────┼──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ REJECTED →  │              │ Same submit() method — REJECTED is in      │
  │ SUBMITTED   │ ✅ Yes       │ SUBMITTABLE_STATUSES, so resubmission      │
  │             │              │ reuses the exact same path.                │
  └─────────────┴──────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Invalid transitions raise InvalidStatusTransitionError → 409, enforced in the
  service layer, not routers (per CLAUDE.md).

