  (ReceiptRepository.commit_and_refresh). Because the bug is now fixed, those 11
  tests unexpectedly pass, and strict=True turns an unexpected pass into a
  reported failure. The fix is real and verified (both by live HTTP smoke tests
  and by this suite's own non-xfail tests); the test file's xfail markers are
  simply stale and need removing — that's a one-line-per-test cleanup, not a
  regression.

